                    "level": {
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "Your lithe, humanoid shape is designed for speed and accuracy suitable for ranged combat. You gain the Automaton Aim action.\n\n**Automaton Aim**\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n\nYou steady your body and observe the events of the battlefield to maximize the range of your next shot. You reduce the penalty for firing into your weapon's second range increment from \u20132 to 0 for the next ranged attack you make this turn. You can use this action a second time in the same turn to reduce the penalty from firing into your weapon's third range increment from \u20134 to 0 for the next ranged attack you make this turn."
                    }
                  }
                }
